##  Repository Structure

```text
Python-QA-Automation-Engine/
├── .gitignore             # Excludes venv, pytest cache, and temporary files
├── README.md              # Project documentation and setup guide
├── requirements.txt       # Frozen Python dependencies
├── test_login.py          # Automated authentication test scenarios
└── test_checkout.py       # End-to-end checkout & shopping cart test scenarios